- FE->BE->PostgreSQL login/order/Mock/history and restart persistence under the default production settings: BLOCKED because backend did not become healthy. Those flows were previously exercised only by the separate development override summarized in SCRUM94_Runtime_Smoke_Safe.log; they are not production or Sandbox evidence.

No credentials, connection strings, cookies, JWTs or signed URLs are recorded. The task project, volume, containers and temporary config were removed after this summary was saved.
